## Honesty

- Desktop Chrome / Firefox / WebKit = native Playwright browsers when installed  
- Edge = Chromium Desktop Edge (optional native `msedge` via `PLAYWRIGHT_EDGE_CHANNEL=1`)  
- Mobile Safari / iPad = WebKit + device descriptors  
- Chrome iOS / Samsung Internet = Chromium + UA (not real WKWebView / Samsung binary)  
- Physical-device Owner visual ≠ this engine

